  "body": "In the [CloseEvent definition](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/web-sockets.html#the-closeevent-interface) it says that WebSocket close events use the `CloseEvent` type for their objects.\r\n\r\nHowever, in the [close event definition](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/indices.html#event-close) it says the Interface type is `Event`. This should be `CloseEvent` surely? Or something like \"CloseEvent for WebSockets, Event otherwise\"?",
